This magnet picks up the nail.

4
00:00:17.089 --> 00:00:24.499
This magnet picks up the screwdriver.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.519
This magnet picks up the hairpin.

6
00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:36.864
This magnet picks up the paper clip.

7
00:00:36.865 --> 00:00:43.270
